          "description": "The Word editor draws the page into an off-screen bitmap and blits it on every scroll, so a large buffer costs memory and background drawing time. Smaller can scroll more smoothly on high-resolution screens, at the cost of redrawing more during a fast fling. Stock is the app's own value.",
